{"id":"vol9-02","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-02/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":499.65,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.78,"text":"Section 4. You will hear an extract from a talk entitled, Health on the Night Shift.","words":[["Section",0.0,0.38],["4.",0.38,0.82],["You",1.52,1.82],["will",1.82,1.96],["hear",1.96,2.16],["an",2.16,2.32],["extract",2.32,2.66],["from",2.66,3.06],["a",3.06,3.24],["talk",3.24,3.48],["entitled,",3.48,4.0],["Health",4.52,4.76],["on",4.76,5.14],["the",5.14,5.24],["Night",5.24,5.46],["Shift.",5.46,5.78]]},{"start":6.94,"end":13.68,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on pages 8 and 9.","words":[["First,",6.94,7.64],["you",7.84,7.86],["have",7.86,8.02],["some",8.02,8.2],["time",8.2,8.5],["to",8.5,8.7],["look",8.7,8.84],["at",8.84,9.0],["questions",9.0,9.38],["31",9.38,10.48],["to",10.48,10.82],["40",10.82,11.26],["on",11.26,12.0],["pages",12.0,12.42],["8",12.42,12.88],["and",12.88,13.3],["9.",13.3,13.68]]},{"start":54.27,"end":58.13,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",54.27,54.51],["listen",54.51,54.79],["carefully",54.79,55.25],["and",55.25,55.73],["answer",55.73,55.99],["questions",55.99,56.47],["31",56.47,57.31],["to",57.31,57.73],["40.",57.73,58.13]]},{"start":61.61,"end":68.47,"text":"Good afternoon, everybody. In this session, I want to continue looking at health issues relating to the workplace.","words":[["Good",61.61,62.09],["afternoon,",62.09,62.53],["everybody.",62.63,62.91],["In",63.81,64.09],["this",64.09,64.29],["session,",64.29,64.71],["I",64.71,64.99],["want",64.99,65.19],["to",65.19,65.35],["continue",65.35,65.73],["looking",65.73,66.01],["at",66.01,66.27],["health",66.27,66.53],["issues",66.53,67.03],["relating",67.03,67.49],["to",67.49,67.85],["the",67.85,67.99],["workplace.",67.99,68.47]]},{"start":68.47,"end":74.59,"text":"And I'd like to focus today on night shift workers and the health problems that are associated","words":[["And",68.47,69.57],["I'd",69.57,69.75],["like",69.75,69.85],["to",69.85,70.01],["focus",70.01,70.29],["today",70.29,70.69],["on",70.69,70.97],["night",70.97,71.29],["shift",71.29,71.59],["workers",71.59,71.97],["and",71.97,72.71],["the",72.71,72.87],["health",72.87,73.09],["problems",73.09,73.61],["that",73.61,73.89],["are",73.89,74.05],["associated",74.05,74.59]]},{"start":74.59,"end":75.73,"text":"with their working hours.","words":[["with",74.59,74.95],["their",74.95,75.13],["working",75.13,75.41],["hours.",75.41,75.73]]},{"start":76.73,"end":81.21,"text":"I'm sure you're all aware that there has been a huge increase in the number of workers","words":[["I'm",76.73,77.29],["sure",77.29,77.51],["you're",77.51,77.73],["all",77.73,77.97],["aware",77.97,78.31],["that",78.31,78.57],["there",78.57,78.75],["has",78.75,78.87],["been",78.87,79.05],["a",79.05,79.15],["huge",79.15,79.55],["increase",79.55,80.03],["in",80.03,80.29],["the",80.29,80.37],["number",80.37,80.67],["of",80.67,80.85],["workers",80.85,81.21]]},{"start":81.21,"end":86.59,"text":"doing regular night shifts in recent years, mainly because of the number of shops and","words":[["doing",81.21,81.53],["regular",81.53,82.13],["night",82.13,82.45],["shifts",82.45,82.77],["in",82.77,83.03],["recent",83.03,83.29],["years,",83.29,83.71],["mainly",83.91,84.67],["because",84.67,85.09],["of",85.09,85.37],["the",85.37,85.47],["number",85.47,85.73],["of",85.73,85.89],["shops",85.89,86.29],["and",86.29,86.59]]},{"start":86.59,"end":90.21,"text":"services now open 24 hours, seven days a week.","words":[["services",86.59,87.11],["now",87.11,87.53],["open",87.53,87.89],["24",87.89,88.37],["hours,",88.37,88.89],["seven",89.25,89.57],["days",89.57,89.81],["a",89.81,90.03],["week.",90.03,90.21]]},{"start":90.81,"end":95.67,"text":"And we need to look more closely at the consequences of changing work and sleep patterns","words":[["And",90.81,91.11],["we",91.11,91.25],["need",91.25,91.39],["to",91.39,91.51],["look",91.51,91.69],["more",91.69,91.89],["closely",91.89,92.49],["at",92.49,92.77],["the",92.77,92.87],["consequences",92.87,93.45],["of",93.45,93.91],["changing",93.91,94.39],["work",94.39,94.81],["and",94.81,95.01],["sleep",95.01,95.25],["patterns",95.25,95.67]]},{"start":95.67,"end":96.19,"text":"like this.","words":[["like",95.67,95.95],["this.",95.95,96.19]]},{"start":96.91,"end":99.01,"text":"So, that's what I'd like us to do today.","words":[["So,",96.91,97.43],["that's",97.49,97.77],["what",97.77,97.91],["I'd",97.91,98.11],["like",98.11,98.21],["us",98.21,98.43],["to",98.43,98.57],["do",98.57,98.69],["today.",98.69,99.01]]},{"start":100.05,"end":105.35,"text":"Now, research that has been carried out in both the U.S. and Britain on night-working","words":[["Now,",100.05,100.47],["research",100.61,101.01],["that",101.01,101.39],["has",101.39,101.55],["been",101.55,101.69],["carried",101.69,102.03],["out",102.03,102.25],["in",102.25,102.55],["both",102.55,102.83],["the",102.83,103.09],["U",103.09,103.35],[".S.",103.35,103.57],["and",103.63,103.75],["Britain",103.75,104.07],["on",104.07,104.79],["night",104.79,105.01],["-working",105.01,105.35]]},{"start":105.87,"end":110.47,"text":"suggests that it leads to a lot of health problems for the workers, and they point","words":[["suggests",105.87,106.19],["that",106.19,106.81],["it",106.81,106.93],["leads",106.93,107.17],["to",107.17,107.39],["a",107.39,107.51],["lot",107.51,107.81],["of",107.81,107.95],["health",107.95,108.17],["problems",108.17,108.69],["for",108.69,108.89],["the",108.89,108.99],["workers,",108.99,109.31],["and",109.73,110.09],["they",110.09,110.21],["point",110.21,110.47]]},{"start":110.47,"end":112.13,"text":"to three main reasons for this.","words":[["to",110.47,110.67],["three",110.67,110.95],["main",110.95,111.25],["reasons",111.25,111.69],["for",111.69,111.95],["this.",111.95,112.13]]},{"start":112.81,"end":119.03,"text":"The first one is what they call the internal clock, and this is a basic sort of program","words":[["The",112.81,113.33],["first",113.33,113.57],["one",113.57,113.85],["is",113.85,114.11],["what",114.11,114.29],["they",114.29,114.47],["call",114.47,114.81],["the",114.81,115.05],["internal",115.05,115.63],["clock,",115.63,116.13],["and",116.65,117.15],["this",117.15,117.33],["is",117.33,117.47],["a",117.47,117.57],["basic",117.57,117.95],["sort",117.95,118.29],["of",118.29,118.47],["program",118.47,119.03]]},{"start":119.03,"end":119.93,"text":"in our brains.","words":[["in",119.03,119.35],["our",119.35,119.49],["brains.",119.49,119.93]]},{"start":120.51,"end":125.97,"text":"This tells us that at certain times we should feel hungry, at other times we should be","words":[["This",120.51,120.91],["tells",120.91,121.25],["us",121.25,121.53],["that",121.53,121.75],["at",121.75,121.89],["certain",121.89,122.23],["times",122.23,122.77],["we",122.77,123.01],["should",123.01,123.19],["feel",123.19,123.39],["hungry,",123.39,123.83],["at",124.29,124.55],["other",124.55,124.71],["times",124.71,125.23],["we",125.23,125.55],["should",125.55,125.79],["be",125.79,125.97]]},{"start":125.97,"end":131.97,"text":"awake. At other times, we should be asleep, and so on. And it seems to be generally accepted","words":[["awake.",125.97,126.29],["At",126.75,126.89],["other",126.89,127.07],["times,",127.07,127.53],["we",127.85,127.95],["should",127.95,128.11],["be",128.11,128.27],["asleep,",128.27,128.69],["and",128.79,128.93],["so",128.93,129.15],["on.",129.15,129.37],["And",130.09,130.23],["it",130.23,130.35],["seems",130.35,130.55],["to",130.55,130.71],["be",130.71,130.85],["generally",130.85,131.31],["accepted",131.31,131.97]]},{"start":131.97,"end":138.89,"text":"by all the experts in the field that this clock is linked to not just our behavioral","words":[["by",131.97,132.37],["all",132.37,132.69],["the",132.69,132.85],["experts",132.85,133.27],["in",133.27,133.47],["the",133.47,133.59],["field",133.59,133.89],["that",133.89,134.09],["this",134.09,134.27],["clock",134.27,134.69],["is",134.69,135.51],["linked",135.51,135.85],["to",135.85,136.29],["not",136.29,137.63],["just",137.63,137.97],["our",137.97,138.27],["behavioral",138.27,138.89]]},{"start":138.89,"end":145.39,"text":"habits, but to cycles of light and dark. And that means that we're programmed to be awake","words":[["habits,",138.89,139.57],["but",140.09,140.51],["to",140.51,140.71],["cycles",140.71,141.05],["of",141.05,141.69],["light",141.69,141.97],["and",141.97,142.19],["dark.",142.19,142.49],["And",142.65,142.71],["that",142.71,142.87],["means",142.87,143.15],["that",143.15,143.85],["we're",143.85,144.05],["programmed",144.05,144.45],["to",144.45,144.73],["be",144.73,144.87],["awake",144.87,145.39]]},{"start":145.39,"end":151.77,"text":"when it's light, i.e. during the day, and to sleep when it's dark. The second thing","words":[["when",145.39,145.81],["it's",145.81,146.03],["light,",146.03,146.33],["i",146.81,147.03],[".e.",147.03,147.21],["during",147.23,147.43],["the",147.43,147.61],["day,",147.61,147.93],["and",148.23,148.77],["to",148.77,148.91],["sleep",148.91,149.19],["when",149.19,149.43],["it's",149.43,149.67],["dark.",149.67,149.91],["The",150.51,150.99],["second",150.99,151.33],["thing",151.33,151.77]]},{"start":151.77,"end":157.57,"text":"is that night workers are continually fighting against what is termed a sleep","words":[["is",151.77,152.33],["that",152.33,152.85],["night",152.85,153.21],["workers",153.21,153.53],["are",153.53,154.05],["continually",154.05,154.79],["fighting",154.79,155.39],["against",155.39,155.91],["what",155.91,156.47],["is",156.47,156.63],["termed",156.63,157.13],["a",157.13,157.25],["sleep",157.25,157.57]]},{"start":157.57,"end":164.53,"text":"debt. And by this the researchers mean that it's just practically impossible for","words":[["debt.",157.57,157.95],["And",158.77,159.23],["by",159.23,159.39],["this",159.39,159.67],["the",159.67,159.87],["researchers",159.87,160.35],["mean",160.35,160.71],["that",160.71,161.03],["it's",161.03,162.55],["just",162.55,162.79],["practically",162.79,163.37],["impossible",163.37,163.95],["for",163.95,164.53]]},{"start":164.53,"end":169.55,"text":"them to get a sufficient amount of sleep in daylight hours. In fact studies","words":[["them",164.53,164.77],["to",164.77,164.99],["get",164.99,165.13],["a",165.13,165.23],["sufficient",165.23,165.61],["amount",165.61,165.89],["of",165.89,166.07],["sleep",166.07,166.37],["in",166.37,166.93],["daylight",166.93,167.31],["hours.",167.31,167.69],["In",168.25,168.39],["fact",168.39,168.73],["studies",168.73,169.55]]},{"start":169.55,"end":174.35,"text":"suggest that on average night workers only get between five and six hours of","words":[["suggest",169.55,170.05],["that",170.05,170.31],["on",170.31,170.41],["average",170.41,170.83],["night",170.83,171.25],["workers",171.25,171.61],["only",171.61,172.07],["get",172.07,172.33],["between",172.33,172.67],["five",172.67,173.35],["and",173.35,173.63],["six",173.63,173.87],["hours",173.87,174.15],["of",174.15,174.35]]},{"start":174.35,"end":179.55,"text":"sleep rather than the eight they need. And the effects of not getting enough","words":[["sleep",174.35,174.71],["rather",174.71,175.47],["than",175.47,175.73],["the",175.73,175.87],["eight",175.87,176.19],["they",176.19,176.43],["need.",176.43,176.87],["And",177.53,178.13],["the",178.13,178.21],["effects",178.21,178.51],["of",178.51,178.73],["not",178.73,178.97],["getting",178.97,179.25],["enough",179.25,179.55]]},{"start":179.55,"end":183.99,"text":"sleep can also lead to all sorts of problems, and we'll talk about those in a minute.","words":[["sleep",179.55,179.89],["can",179.89,180.13],["also",180.13,180.41],["lead",180.41,180.67],["to",180.67,180.85],["all",180.85,181.09],["sorts",181.09,181.41],["of",181.41,181.53],["problems,",181.53,181.91],["and",182.27,182.67],["we'll",182.67,182.93],["talk",182.93,183.19],["about",183.19,183.35],["those",183.35,183.57],["in",183.57,183.73],["a",183.73,183.85],["minute.",183.85,183.99]]},{"start":185.13,"end":190.51,"text":"The third cause of these problems is the unsocial hours that night workers have to keep.","words":[["The",185.13,185.41],["third",185.41,185.65],["cause",185.65,185.97],["of",185.97,186.23],["these",186.23,186.41],["problems",186.41,186.99],["is",186.99,187.67],["the",187.67,187.83],["unsocial",187.83,188.45],["hours",188.45,188.99],["that",188.99,189.23],["night",189.23,189.43],["workers",189.43,189.73],["have",189.73,190.05],["to",190.05,190.19],["keep.",190.19,190.51]]},{"start":191.19,"end":196.89,"text":"The fact that they are working when their families, their friends are sleeping, and vice-versa,","words":[["The",191.19,191.37],["fact",191.37,191.65],["that",191.65,191.85],["they",191.85,191.97],["are",191.97,192.07],["working",192.07,192.41],["when",192.41,192.69],["their",192.69,192.91],["families,",192.91,193.55],["their",193.91,194.01],["friends",194.01,194.61],["are",194.61,194.91],["sleeping,",194.91,195.35],["and",195.89,196.13],["vice",196.13,196.35],["-versa,",196.35,196.89]]},{"start":197.53,"end":202.93,"text":"and that kind of dislocation from their social group can be very damaging.","words":[["and",197.53,197.81],["that",197.81,199.11],["kind",199.11,199.43],["of",199.43,199.59],["dislocation",199.59,200.43],["from",200.43,201.07],["their",201.07,201.23],["social",201.23,201.59],["group",201.59,201.97],["can",201.97,202.15],["be",202.15,202.27],["very",202.27,202.49],["damaging.",202.49,202.93]]},{"start":208.15,"end":211.77,"text":"Okay, so let's take a closer look at some of these effects.","words":[["Okay,",208.15,208.71],["so",209.13,209.55],["let's",209.55,209.99],["take",209.99,210.13],["a",210.13,210.25],["closer",210.25,210.53],["look",210.53,210.77],["at",210.77,210.93],["some",210.93,211.11],["of",211.11,211.23],["these",211.23,211.35],["effects.",211.35,211.77]]},{"start":211.77,"end":218.89,"text":"And if we have a look at the physical effects first, we can see that studies on long-term shift","words":[["And",211.77,212.85],["if",212.85,213.37],["we",213.37,213.93],["have",213.93,214.21],["a",214.21,214.31],["look",214.31,214.45],["at",214.45,214.59],["the",214.59,214.69],["physical",214.69,215.15],["effects",215.15,215.57],["first,",215.57,215.95],["we",216.47,216.91],["can",216.91,217.09],["see",217.09,217.29],["that",217.29,217.45],["studies",217.45,217.79],["on",217.79,218.07],["long",218.07,218.35],["-term",218.35,218.61],["shift",218.61,218.89]]},{"start":218.89,"end":224.95,"text":"workers found that they were much more likely to get heart problems than day workers. In addition,","words":[["workers",218.89,219.29],["found",219.29,220.07],["that",220.07,220.27],["they",220.27,220.45],["were",220.45,220.57],["much",220.57,220.91],["more",220.91,221.09],["likely",221.09,221.39],["to",221.39,221.63],["get",221.63,221.77],["heart",221.77,222.17],["problems",222.17,222.71],["than",222.71,223.01],["day",223.01,223.33],["workers.",223.33,223.69],["In",224.43,224.55],["addition,",224.55,224.95]]},{"start":225.63,"end":231.29,"text":"there seems to be a very high incidence of stomach problems, for example, ulcers among","words":[["there",225.63,225.85],["seems",225.85,226.13],["to",226.13,226.31],["be",226.31,226.53],["a",226.53,226.79],["very",226.79,227.05],["high",227.05,227.39],["incidence",227.39,227.73],["of",227.73,228.15],["stomach",228.15,228.51],["problems,",228.51,229.09],["for",229.47,229.53],["example,",229.53,229.95],["ulcers",230.41,230.85],["among",230.85,231.29]]},{"start":231.29,"end":236.09,"text":"night shift workers. And although this may be partly due to the wrong sort of diet,","words":[["night",231.29,231.63],["shift",231.63,231.83],["workers.",231.83,232.27],["And",232.81,233.11],["although",233.11,233.53],["this",233.53,234.01],["may",234.01,234.19],["be",234.19,234.29],["partly",234.29,234.53],["due",234.53,234.83],["to",234.83,234.97],["the",234.97,235.09],["wrong",235.09,235.37],["sort",235.37,235.61],["of",235.61,235.73],["diet,",235.73,236.09]]},{"start":236.09,"end":242.63,"text":"snacking on fast food, it can't be just explained by eating habits.","words":[["snacking",236.09,237.53],["on",237.53,237.67],["fast",237.67,238.01],["food,",238.01,238.39],["it",238.97,239.89],["can't",239.89,240.27],["be",240.27,240.55],["just",240.55,241.03],["explained",241.03,241.67],["by",241.67,241.95],["eating",241.95,242.21],["habits.",242.21,242.63]]},{"start":243.29,"end":247.37,"text":"And finally, there is evidence to suggest that night shift workers","words":[["And",243.29,243.73],["finally,",243.73,244.13],["there",244.63,244.95],["is",244.95,245.15],["evidence",245.15,245.43],["to",245.43,245.71],["suggest",245.71,246.09],["that",246.09,246.33],["night",246.33,246.71],["shift",246.71,246.91],["workers",246.91,247.37]]},{"start":247.37,"end":252.77,"text":"also get ill more frequently with minor problems like colds and infections.","words":[["also",247.37,248.25],["get",248.25,248.53],["ill",248.53,248.97],["more",248.97,249.25],["frequently",249.25,249.77],["with",249.77,250.21],["minor",250.21,250.69],["problems",250.69,251.21],["like",251.21,251.59],["colds",251.59,252.25],["and",252.25,252.31],["infections.",252.31,252.77]]},{"start":253.69,"end":258.33,"text":"The frequency of these illnesses is much higher than among day workers,","words":[["The",253.69,253.95],["frequency",253.95,254.35],["of",254.35,254.87],["these",254.87,255.17],["illnesses",255.17,255.71],["is",255.71,256.65],["much",256.65,256.91],["higher",256.91,257.27],["than",257.27,257.47],["among",257.47,257.75],["day",257.75,258.01],["workers,",258.01,258.33]]},{"start":258.73,"end":263.29,"text":"and this indicates that night working can damage immunity to illness.","words":[["and",258.73,259.11],["this",259.11,259.31],["indicates",259.31,259.75],["that",259.75,260.43],["night",260.43,260.85],["working",260.85,261.23],["can",261.23,261.57],["damage",261.57,262.05],["immunity",262.05,262.67],["to",262.67,262.99],["illness.",262.99,263.29]]},{"start":263.29,"end":267.65,"text":"And, of course, this leads to a lot of absence from work, too.","words":[["And,",263.29,264.25],["of",264.33,264.43],["course,",264.43,264.73],["this",265.15,265.43],["leads",265.43,265.75],["to",265.75,265.99],["a",265.99,266.13],["lot",266.13,266.27],["of",266.27,266.41],["absence",266.41,266.85],["from",266.85,267.15],["work,",267.15,267.39],["too.",267.51,267.65]]},{"start":268.81,"end":274.79,"text":"However, although the physical impact of working nights can be severe, perhaps the real problems","words":[["However,",268.81,269.13],["although",269.73,269.97],["the",269.97,270.11],["physical",270.11,270.43],["impact",270.43,270.95],["of",270.95,271.11],["working",271.11,271.35],["nights",271.35,271.65],["can",271.65,271.91],["be",271.91,272.07],["severe,",272.07,272.61],["perhaps",273.21,273.73],["the",273.73,273.93],["real",273.93,274.27],["problems",274.27,274.79]]},{"start":274.79,"end":276.45,"text":"are psychological ones.","words":[["are",274.79,275.23],["psychological",275.23,275.97],["ones.",275.97,276.45]]},{"start":277.41,"end":279.95,"text":"And the most common problem is depression.","words":[["And",277.41,277.91],["the",277.91,278.03],["most",278.03,278.19],["common",278.19,278.51],["problem",278.51,278.97],["is",278.97,279.55],["depression.",279.55,279.95]]},{"start":280.73,"end":286.19,"text":"This seems to be the inevitable result of the constant feeling of tiredness and a lack","words":[["This",280.73,281.03],["seems",281.03,281.37],["to",281.37,281.57],["be",281.57,281.71],["the",281.71,281.83],["inevitable",281.83,282.23],["result",282.23,282.71],["of",282.71,283.31],["the",283.31,283.45],["constant",283.45,283.93],["feeling",283.93,284.39],["of",284.39,284.61],["tiredness",284.61,285.37],["and",285.37,285.91],["a",285.91,286.05],["lack",286.05,286.19]]},{"start":286.19,"end":289.25,"text":"of energy that night workers universally complain of.","words":[["of",286.19,286.31],["energy",286.31,286.71],["that",286.71,286.95],["night",286.95,287.15],["workers",287.15,287.49],["universally",287.49,288.57],["complain",288.57,288.95],["of.",288.95,289.25]]},{"start":290.17,"end":295.59,"text":"Secondly, there is a lot of evidence from accident statistics to suggest that mental","words":[["Secondly,",290.17,290.85],["there",291.33,291.55],["is",291.55,291.71],["a",291.71,291.81],["lot",291.81,291.95],["of",291.95,292.09],["evidence",292.09,292.39],["from",292.39,292.71],["accident",292.71,293.37],["statistics",293.37,294.05],["to",294.05,294.39],["suggest",294.39,294.79],["that",294.79,295.13],["mental",295.13,295.59]]},{"start":295.59,"end":302.31,"text":"abilities are badly affected, and that means, for example, decision-making ability and planning","words":[["abilities",295.59,296.07],["are",296.07,296.85],["badly",296.85,297.27],["affected,",297.27,297.73],["and",297.91,298.07],["that",298.07,298.31],["means,",298.31,298.61],["for",298.71,298.85],["example,",298.85,299.29],["decision",299.97,300.57],["-making",300.57,300.87],["ability",300.87,301.41],["and",301.41,301.87],["planning",301.87,302.31]]},{"start":302.31,"end":302.81,"text":"ability.","words":[["ability.",302.31,302.81]]},{"start":303.75,"end":305.53,"text":"And these are what control our performance.","words":[["And",303.75,303.91],["these",303.91,304.15],["are",304.15,304.29],["what",304.29,304.41],["control",304.41,304.83],["our",304.83,305.01],["performance.",305.01,305.53]]},{"start":306.33,"end":311.75,"text":"For example, we can see that the highest number of errors on the roads occur between","words":[["For",306.33,306.49],["example,",306.49,306.83],["we",306.97,307.15],["can",307.15,307.33],["see",307.33,307.69],["that",307.69,307.95],["the",307.95,308.17],["highest",308.17,308.51],["number",308.51,308.95],["of",308.95,309.11],["errors",309.11,309.51],["on",309.51,309.77],["the",309.77,309.89],["roads",309.89,310.41],["occur",310.41,311.33],["between",311.33,311.75]]},{"start":311.75,"end":317.45,"text":"between 3 a.m. and 5 a.m., the point in our internal clock, when we feel most sleepy.","words":[["between",311.75,311.87],["3",311.87,312.17],["a",312.17,312.37],[".m.",312.37,312.53],["and",312.55,312.63],["5",312.63,312.93],["a",312.93,313.21],[".m.,",313.21,313.79],["the",313.79,314.01],["point",314.01,314.29],["in",314.29,314.53],["our",314.53,314.75],["internal",314.75,315.33],["clock,",315.33,315.75],["when",316.19,316.47],["we",316.47,316.63],["feel",316.63,316.85],["most",316.85,317.09],["sleepy.",317.09,317.45]]},{"start":319.55,"end":325.97,"text":"Okay, finally, there are the social problems, where night-working impacts on the family","words":[["Okay,",319.55,320.15],["finally,",320.15,320.75],["there",321.09,321.51],["are",321.51,321.77],["the",321.77,321.95],["social",321.95,322.29],["problems,",322.29,322.83],["where",322.97,323.23],["night",323.23,324.09],["-working",324.09,324.29],["impacts",324.29,324.99],["on",324.99,325.31],["the",325.31,325.45],["family",325.45,325.97]]},{"start":325.97,"end":327.93,"text":"and social life of the employees.","words":[["and",325.97,326.39],["social",326.39,326.77],["life",326.77,327.13],["of",327.13,327.31],["the",327.31,327.43],["employees.",327.43,327.93]]},{"start":328.79,"end":333.93,"text":"The first one is obviously the break-up of family life, and here we can see from the","words":[["The",328.79,329.05],["first",329.05,329.25],["one",329.25,329.49],["is",329.49,329.65],["obviously",329.65,330.11],["the",330.11,330.43],["break",330.43,330.71],["-up",330.71,330.93],["of",330.93,331.07],["family",331.07,331.37],["life,",331.37,331.73],["and",332.05,332.61],["here",332.61,332.85],["we",332.85,333.03],["can",333.03,333.17],["see",333.17,333.47],["from",333.47,333.75],["the",333.75,333.93]]},{"start":333.93,"end":338.67,"text":"divorce statistics that this occurs more frequently in the case of night-workers.","words":[["divorce",333.93,334.35],["statistics",334.35,334.91],["that",334.91,335.71],["this",335.71,335.91],["occurs",335.91,336.27],["more",336.27,336.61],["frequently",336.61,337.07],["in",337.07,337.45],["the",337.45,337.55],["case",337.55,337.81],["of",337.81,338.11],["night",338.11,338.31],["-workers.",338.31,338.67]]},{"start":338.67,"end":346.25,"text":"But there's also the breakdown of other relationships, not just within the family, but among the peer group.","words":[["But",338.67,339.97],["there's",339.97,340.37],["also",340.37,340.61],["the",340.61,340.77],["breakdown",340.77,341.17],["of",341.17,341.67],["other",341.67,341.93],["relationships,",341.93,342.51],["not",343.01,343.33],["just",343.33,343.57],["within",343.57,343.85],["the",343.85,344.05],["family,",344.05,344.47],["but",344.77,345.19],["among",345.19,345.45],["the",345.45,345.65],["peer",345.65,345.85],["group.",345.85,346.25]]},{"start":346.85,"end":357.87,"text":"Night workers tend to lose touch with friends, and these relationships, especially for the long-term night workers, are very difficult to rebuild.","words":[["Night",346.85,347.29],["workers",347.29,347.57],["tend",347.57,348.31],["to",348.31,348.49],["lose",348.49,348.75],["touch",348.75,349.07],["with",349.07,349.25],["friends,",349.25,349.71],["and",350.13,350.61],["these",350.61,350.85],["relationships,",350.85,351.55],["especially",351.69,352.09],["for",352.09,353.05],["the",353.05,353.23],["long",353.23,353.59],["-term",353.59,353.83],["night",353.83,354.11],["workers,",354.11,354.45],["are",354.99,355.37],["very",355.37,356.91],["difficult",356.91,357.33],["to",357.33,357.57],["rebuild.",357.57,357.87]]},{"start":358.63,"end":362.65,"text":"And so this eventually leads to social isolation for the individual.","words":[["And",358.63,358.87],["so",358.87,359.29],["this",359.29,359.55],["eventually",359.55,360.03],["leads",360.03,360.57],["to",360.57,360.81],["social",360.81,361.19],["isolation",361.19,361.85],["for",361.85,362.09],["the",362.09,362.19],["individual.",362.19,362.65]]},{"start":363.17,"end":366.49,"text":"And of course that has consequences for the whole community too.","words":[["And",363.17,363.49],["of",363.49,363.63],["course",363.63,363.91],["that",363.91,364.19],["has",364.19,364.39],["consequences",364.39,364.91],["for",364.91,365.43],["the",365.43,365.55],["whole",365.55,365.73],["community",365.73,366.21],["too.",366.21,366.49]]},{"start":366.49,"end":373.51,"text":"so we can begin to see the real cost of night working what we need to do now","words":[["so",366.49,366.99],["we",366.99,368.79],["can",368.79,368.97],["begin",368.97,369.19],["to",369.19,369.41],["see",369.41,369.59],["the",369.59,369.77],["real",369.77,370.11],["cost",370.11,370.63],["of",370.63,370.89],["night",370.89,371.15],["working",371.15,371.49],["what",371.49,372.39],["we",372.39,372.61],["need",372.61,372.75],["to",372.75,372.99],["do",372.99,373.11],["now",373.11,373.51]]},{"start":373.51,"end":383.96,"text":"is to look that is the end of section four you now have half a minute to check","words":[["is",373.51,374.17],["to",374.17,374.43],["look",374.43,374.59],["that",378.88,379.38],["is",379.38,379.64],["the",379.64,379.82],["end",379.82,380.04],["of",380.04,380.16],["section",380.16,380.42],["four",380.42,380.92],["you",380.92,382.0],["now",382.0,382.2],["have",382.2,382.52],["half",382.52,382.96],["a",382.96,383.08],["minute",383.08,383.32],["to",383.32,383.74],["check",383.74,383.96]]},{"start":383.96,"end":420.1,"text":"your answers that is the end of the listening test you now have 10 minutes","words":[["your",383.96,384.16],["answers",384.16,384.52],["that",384.52,385.7],["is",415.42,415.68],["the",415.68,415.88],["end",415.88,416.26],["of",416.26,416.44],["the",416.44,416.56],["listening",416.56,416.86],["test",416.86,417.4],["you",417.4,418.7],["now",418.7,418.92],["have",418.92,419.24],["10",419.24,419.66],["minutes",419.66,420.1]]},{"start":420.1,"end":423.56,"text":"to transfer your answers to the listening answer sheet","words":[["to",420.1,420.72],["transfer",420.72,42